<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<contentList>
        <content contentuid="hb92cce98g1ecag551ag8629g29b86e5b8806" version="1">Grit</content>
        <content contentuid="hdc1c56adgf05dg569ag900cgae56bdaf67e3" version="1">A gunslinger's pool of nerve and daring. Spend Grit to fuel trick shots and desperate gambits. Grit is restored to its maximum after a long rest, and you regain 1 point whenever you score a critical hit or reduce a creature to 0 hit points with a firearm attack.</content>
        <content contentuid="h59247562g97d5g5328gb92cgc40a691449d6" version="1">Flintlock Cylinder</content>
        <content contentuid="h3dd3ac2dg0f1bg537fg90dag3efac0bcf7f8" version="1">The number of shots loaded in a flintlock pistol. Spend 1 to fire; use a Reload action to refill.</content>
        <content contentuid="hd15dec2bg442eg5b67gae9dg9a8f904f50a8" version="1">Blunderbuss Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="h06431e21g75fbg505fga4b0gd438d071bf5b" version="1">The number of shots loaded in a blunderbuss. Spend 1 to fire; use a Reload action to refill.</content>
        <content contentuid="hd0616debgd485g57aeg82d7g45798f9014a9" version="1">Musket Cartridge</content>
        <content contentuid="ha6242459g9908g5797gaa4bgf43cc12e9fdf" version="1">The number of shots loaded in a musket. Spend 1 to fire; use a Reload action to refill.</content>
        <content contentuid="hcca1f6e2g2be7g585cga49bg43f4bab1ac9d" version="1">Gunsmithing Charges</content>
        <content contentuid="hdba6e3b8gda0dg516fg8106gfeb8848fd33d" version="1">The number of firearms you can assemble from raw materials before you must rest and restock components. Restores to maximum after a long rest.</content>
        <content contentuid="h2d64fb40gecc2g56cfg83c8ge48b80e74c1a" version="1">Gunslinger</content>
        <content contentuid="h42e78561gf8c0g5553gbe74gf8eaa40968ea" version="1">A firearm-focused duelist who fuels trick shots and desperate gambits with Grit, a pool of nerve and daring that recharges after a long rest.</content>
        <content contentuid="h997cc641g4d65g559fgb8c4g6e4ac4ddcd8c" version="1">Specialization</content>
        <content contentuid="h8b16777ege486g53ecg8ccfge41d591d2882" version="1">A patient sharpshooter who specializes in accurate, high-range attacks that deal heavy damage. Strongest when enemies are kept at a distance.</content>
        <content contentuid="h474ae6fbge0f8g50fbg9153g1013fc35955b" version="1">Marksman</content>
        <content contentuid="h84a5ae4cg444cg571egb3d8ge0df9d849549" version="1">Marksman</content>
        <content contentuid="h62a4ed3ag313cg5413gbb5cg52ae8ee964e3" version="1">A bold gunfighter who makes greater use of Grit, spending it on special effects and versatile combat techniques.</content>
        <content contentuid="h4b3872ddg6a21g5396g8709g70e68bcc379c" version="1">Desperado</content>
        <content contentuid="h68e3af46g0e28g5b06g8f2cg3dc59fdf32e6" version="1">Desperado</content>
        <content contentuid="h4dc4990bg35eeg5a26gbaf1gdecb89eb6cd3" version="1">A spellcasting gunfighter who imbues shots with magical effects. Intelligence is the Arcane Gunsman's spellcasting ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h8dce33fdga011g5f05ga6b6gd138af159b4b" version="1">ArcaneGunsman</content>
        <content contentuid="hc5873587g2542g5f10gb920g8ef237599f1d" version="1">ArcaneGunsman</content>
        <content contentuid="h9780c102g240ag52efga3d4gb13e793b2538" version="1">Gunner</content>
        <content contentuid="hc813199fg372fg5d65g9726gbf91f9de4f02" version="1">Gain proficiency with firearms (they use the Sling proficiency group). Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</content>
        <content contentuid="hd2151e63gd92fg5f28g8a51g47b2555d2fc5" version="1">Firearm Proficiency</content>
        <content contentuid="h8fe49679gc007g5b01g8776g6de2ec0fcd7c" version="1">You are proficient with firearms.</content>
        <content contentuid="h822d05e0ge91bg5508gb51fg170bec80fd06" version="1">Firearm Training</content>
        <content contentuid="hbca83974ga19eg577cga666g8d33a1f10697" version="1">Increases your Dexterity score by 1.</content>
        <content contentuid="h152bfd65g7a13g5210g848egf4b3e6c5ade7" version="1">Quick Reload</content>
        <content contentuid="h81d8a202gd9d4g5471g873cg64069f5a17d2" version="1">When dual-wielding two Flintlocks, you can reload both as a bonus action instead of an action. Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</content>
        <content contentuid="h8f5e4ffag0bb9g5041gb895g914d3ce3104a" version="1">Quick Reload</content>
        <content contentuid="h63669565gd150g54a6ga29bg14d2e584f6a7" version="1">You can reload dual-wielded Flintlocks as a bonus action.</content>
        <content contentuid="hb2be8eb9ga022g57a2g8d81g580b18f771c2" version="1">Quick Hands</content>
        <content contentuid="h2ec284b9gefa5g5d71g9312g091ef6f06039" version="1">Increases your Dexterity score by 1.</content>
        <content contentuid="hb3ef2296g5489g5323g804fgbc950b19f840" version="1">Grit Adept</content>
        <content contentuid="h057a18e6gf320g5384g8f0cg935604752fc1" version="1">Increase your maximum grit points by 2 and choose one grit ability available to a level 3 Gunslinger.</content>
        <content contentuid="h15bd841dgfae1g5147gb414g0ce21b37f52f" version="1">Grit Adept</content>
        <content contentuid="hb50a250ag92d2g5df8ga2e3gc45d95e4917c" version="1">Increases your maximum grit points by 2.</content>
        <content contentuid="hfe3fc1adgd09fg528dg9c17g07a9c9ded6a6" version="1">Close-Quarters Gunner</content>
        <content contentuid="h66b30a07g43c0g5a3agbc41ga9802954ac42" version="1">Blunderbuss attacks do not suffer penalties from nearby enemies. Once per turn, hitting a creature within 15 feet with a firearm can push it 5 feet. Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</content>
        <content contentuid="h50bb50edgd484g5a95gbcfcg1273431e8b4c" version="1">Close-Quarters Gunner</content>
        <content contentuid="h82212626ge6ccg563cg95d1g231dd57825d0" version="1">Once per turn, a firearm hit against a creature within 15 feet pushes it 5 feet.</content>
        <content contentuid="h34a62d26g3dabg5ed2gaaf6g8a1383bf7efb" version="1">Steady Hands</content>
        <content contentuid="h4d4b0115ge158g5dafgba1eg26e231e3952a" version="1">Increases your Dexterity score by 1.</content>
        <content contentuid="h39d746fcgef1eg5e46gbf97gb2a8b39788e2" version="1">Longarm Specialist</content>
        <content contentuid="h1dda5dd0g4202g5414g85b2ge2bdc0ff9ae1" version="1">Musket attacks ignore long-range penalties and gain 20 feet of normal range. Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</content>
        <content contentuid="h59aaf8a3g5c11g500aga433gd1f52205f1b3" version="1">Longarm Specialist</content>
        <content contentuid="hd5c74955gd9dbg5a53gbcfbgf81b55d714f6" version="1">Your musket attacks ignore long-range penalties.</content>
        <content contentuid="he363c076g6a22g5ba8g9cb8ge57da773fdd7" version="1">Long Range Training</content>
        <content contentuid="h559e6207g14c3g5bf9g82d5gc45aa514884a" version="1">Increases your Dexterity score by 1.</content>
        <content contentuid="h87f20920gbd0fg5f9ega347g9fca442b57ad" version="1">Called Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="h63755c1bg1d36g5c3bg8deeg2be5897f57e7" version="1">Once per turn, when you hit a creature with a firearm from at least 30 feet away, it suffers Disadvantage on its next attack before the end of its next turn. Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</content>
        <content contentuid="he888357dg677fg5ed9gbf20g36ea7f66d135" version="1">Called Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="heb0bf59agc5ebg5bccgb4c1gce3b66b7d955" version="1">Disadvantage on your next attack roll.</content>
        <content contentuid="h32940c53g07deg5162g8e10g7b22025bcf4b" version="1">Called Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="hde2089a1g083bg58c6gbe7agcae08f66d776" version="1">Once per turn, a firearm hit from 30 feet or more away gives the target Disadvantage on its next attack roll.</content>
        <content contentuid="hc5fa9067ge726g5d16gb6e0g651d8e55989f" version="1">Marksman's Eye</content>
        <content contentuid="h8b4fb956g2cccg5daag81dfg7900a636ac15" version="1">Increases your Dexterity score by 1.</content>
        <content contentuid="h22be4009g1753g5ce0gb5a9g434c53fd8d23" version="1">Spellshot Adept</content>
        <content contentuid="h0ffdc689g958fg583eg9b51gb8d30604e2f9" version="1">Your firearm attacks count as magical. Once per turn after casting a spell, your next firearm hit deals an extra 1d4 force damage. Increase your Intelligence score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</content>
        <content contentuid="h343f06f4g032dg50e5gb244g0ef356191cc1" version="1">Spellshot</content>
        <content contentuid="hd21dc251gbb07g59e5g91feg4c49a09507b5" version="1">Your firearm attacks count as magical.</content>
        <content contentuid="h2fe64534g03adg5fbdgabecg564403bb298a" version="1">Spellshot Charged</content>
        <content contentuid="he71d0c39gb3f1g5bacgb76dg8d2484248a0d" version="1">Your next firearm hit this turn deals an extra 1d4 Force damage.</content>
        <content contentuid="h017f038dg644eg5818gbf70g1413605fad0f" version="1">Spellshot Adept</content>
        <content contentuid="hd7bbfdebg51c3g51d1gb1c6gb4892e6f30ff" version="1">Once per turn, after you cast a spell, your next firearm hit deals an extra 1d4 Force damage.</content>
        <content contentuid="h1cefb2dagb9fbg5590gaf37g85bee738e876" version="1">Spellshot Adept</content>
        <content contentuid="h3111a0d2g8b4eg5c39gbc24g1f319ce402ee" version="1">Deals the stored Spellshot bonus damage.</content>
        <content contentuid="h631f08b1g749ag5440gbdfegde10a9264afe" version="1">Arcane Marksmanship</content>
        <content contentuid="h45a24d1eg7178g59fegab4fgb70c077dc727" version="1">Increases your Intelligence score by 1.</content>
        <content contentuid="h247dbfadg7a74g54a7ga7cfgfc42b8d919ed" version="1">Merciless Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="hc2fb951agcca1g5d76ga1bag82239a48037c" version="1">Unlocks the Merciless Shot grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h47e712e3g6093g5244g9b7egbd961ca6a71a" version="1">Merciless Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="hbd9f7ccdg6efag577agb117g7e3939ef1f8d" version="1">Your next firearm attack deals extra damage.</content>
        <content contentuid="hdfef9eeag71eeg5d1eg8d24gcedc2c925e8c" version="1">Merciless Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="h6e9afbfcg7e8ag59aega4b1ga8f436401446" version="1">Spend 2 grit points. Your next firearm attack this turn deals an extra 1d8 damage.</content>
        <content contentuid="hde7e2926g15bfg5332g8e16ga25ae7cef4c6" version="1">Line 'em Up</content>
        <content contentuid="hbce4e343g1a96g51acg800fga65933f05925" version="1">Unlocks the Line 'em Up grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h754e9698ga877g5ad9gbae6g65979d3ce3a3" version="1">Line 'em Up</content>
        <content contentuid="h03055657g5991g5c20g94d1g024a02226283" version="1">Spend 2 grit points. Fire through a 20-foot line of enemies, each making a Dexterity save or taking 2d6 Piercing damage (half on a success).</content>
        <content contentuid="h3246abc9g2b62g5a28g8dd9gd3bedfa41609" version="1">Rapid Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="h87f37c94g6910g5a30g82ecgc1dd7877f402" version="1">Unlocks the Rapid Shot grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h9e36cb7agbea2g5843gba93g160ad88227ca" version="1">Rapid Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="h59be6cb2g6da7g53cfg8bb1g2b4b8e32ec0b" version="1">You can make another firearm attack as a bonus action.</content>
        <content contentuid="h5dab5e6bg99d5g533dg83fbgfdd630d0f7b7" version="1">Rapid Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="hec4e9afbg19a5g5af8gbd32g2735c2b99b0d" version="1">Spend 1 grit point to fire again as a bonus action.</content>
        <content contentuid="h04796cd4g6294g5c71gac0bg46b07c90ba93" version="1">Bite the Bullet</content>
        <content contentuid="h0e138025gbac2g5889gb433gf971bb126fd6" version="1">Unlocks the Bite the Bullet grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="hafb61727gc03bg5958g90b3ga9044bdf035b" version="1">Bite the Bullet</content>
        <content contentuid="hfb5aa873gb36eg58a3gaf03gf7b7b26b7d97" version="1">As a bonus action, spend 2 grit points to gain temporary hit points equal to twice your proficiency bonus.</content>
        <content contentuid="h23345878g373eg5e32gb6dbgc9ea48ec8971" version="1">Shot in the Dark</content>
        <content contentuid="hf107b388ga4efg5f00gbf38g1d99812fb35d" version="1">Unlocks the Shot in the Dark grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h206052b1gafcfg5a4bg8a02g22064a972674" version="1">Shot in the Dark</content>
        <content contentuid="h58020396gc5cdg5f36g9031g5d29039ab1a6" version="1">You have Darkvision and ignore the Blinded condition for your next shot.</content>
        <content contentuid="h9d0667c8gfdaeg5a1cg9463g1ff7de4976e7" version="1">Shot in the Dark</content>
        <content contentuid="ha1e675dcg7790g5669ga976gd79d71c200f2" version="1">As a bonus action, spend 1 grit point to gain Darkvision out to 60 feet and ignore Blindness for your next shot.</content>
        <content contentuid="h5926aed9gaee2g591agb986g656004d615c9" version="1">Rapid Repair</content>
        <content contentuid="h5955813dg09f5g53b7g87bdg91ad7b4c0f4e" version="1">Unlocks the Rapid Repair grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h9589d1fbg4953g55b2gbc01g0b1a85bdda5b" version="1">Rapid Repair</content>
        <content contentuid="h9d3c6ac3gb952g5b62g9a7cg5e1501afdda3" version="1">Spend 1 grit point and make a Sleight of Hand check to clear a misfired firearm.</content>
        <content contentuid="hc29dc490gb036g5e94g88d9g2fd21e9adb3b" version="1">Tinkerer</content>
        <content contentuid="h390f2026gce29g565dga887g67ac46d9781d" version="1">Unlocks the Tinkerer grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h03b1cfcdg87e0g5463g8af1g19f2c517dafc" version="1">Tinkered</content>
        <content contentuid="h6c338bfdg0868g56f2g8a71g5d185ecb6dbb" version="1">Your firearm has been modified and deals extra damage until your next long rest.</content>
        <content contentuid="h5cf5a27cg1592g56b4g93a5gc048e11b9ce6" version="1">Tinkerer</content>
        <content contentuid="h43d2552eg84cag5d31gae6eg6266846b7252" version="1">Spend 1 grit point to add a modification to your firearm that increases its damage until your next long rest.</content>
        <content contentuid="h4d7604b0g70abg5e29gb0deg24235336a21b" version="1">Fanning Fire</content>
        <content contentuid="h01862009g89e3g5610gbd73g7cbde620cac9" version="1">Unlocks the Fanning Fire grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h977c48c0g18eeg521cgb9f0g167ce6452355" version="1">Fanning Fire</content>
        <content contentuid="hb22e7e37g4ba5g52d3gb4ecgfa4d425420c6" version="1">You can make two extra firearm attacks this turn at -2 to hit.</content>
        <content contentuid="h3178086bg4305g5971g85e1g0a37f8a4c60d" version="1">Fanning Fire</content>
        <content contentuid="haa822b5cged83g566egb8e6gef6bbe8dd09b" version="1">Spend 2 grit points as an action to make extra firearm attacks against nearby enemies this turn, each at -2 to hit.</content>
        <content contentuid="hfdbc6d02gcb7ag56abgaa91g2ea5a90e644d" version="1">Desperado's Luck</content>
        <content contentuid="h94a64143g6490g531cg90d2g35e4bd2f635b" version="1">Once per turn, your firearm attack rolls gain a +1d4 bonus.</content>
        <content contentuid="h9ff329b1gf028g5572g8be4gf801282dd29e" version="1">Second Attack</content>
        <content contentuid="h40c7e0efg541ag5499gafe0g0477e6b5cec7" version="1">You can attack twice, instead of once, whenever you take the Attack action.</content>
        <content contentuid="h3b5cddd1g217eg53baga9fdg40216cf13fa3" version="1">Weapon Damaged</content>
        <content contentuid="h49e57206gfd40g54edgbfd8ga997830c330d" version="1">This firearm has been damaged beyond a simple field repair. Several hours at the workbench are needed for it to fire again.</content>
        <content contentuid="h40f837d1g07eeg5799g9499gf09ad6bff804" version="1">Double Load</content>
        <content contentuid="h25cce658g804dg561dgb58cg48280491a5a1" version="1">Spend 1 grit point and two bullets to deal 1.5x damage with your next shot. A natural 1 destroys the weapon until your next long rest.</content>
        <content contentuid="hc0ecaab8g4357g5f07g8475g5c5ea510dede" version="1">Double Load</content>
        <content contentuid="hca40d7e3g5210g5ffcg97e8g7e414213dcfa" version="1">Unlocks the Double Load grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="hb1c3fc87gbe52g5aabg8358g288168bb88af" version="1">Close Call</content>
        <content contentuid="h0a71eea9g6fafg5f5fg8d51g0eebfa2882cb" version="1">+2 Armor Class against the triggering attack.</content>
        <content contentuid="hd4802716g567dg5be5gb997gc6edb4df8fce" version="1">Close Call</content>
        <content contentuid="h097c4619ga7e9g54c3gb9d6g6994e1343dcc" version="1">As a reaction, spend 1 grit point to gain +2 AC against an attack. If it misses, make a firearm attack against the attacker.</content>
        <content contentuid="h5512b895g0359g5f61gbd22g2e6be07c6c4b" version="1">Close Call</content>
        <content contentuid="h0980456eg2126g5e0aga897gaefb8d6b0096" version="1">Unlocks the Close Call grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h2edb9dc2g395bg5a39gac97gfd7757788007" version="1">Last Word</content>
        <content contentuid="h0e487865g269fg5d91g8c99gc4df280202d2" version="1">Once per long rest, when damage would reduce you to 0 hit points, spend 3 grit points to be stabilized at 1 hit point instead, then immediately make one firearm attack.</content>
        <content contentuid="hb837ad61gc723g5b12gacf2g4e03699a648e" version="1">Last Word (Spent)</content>
        <content contentuid="h53bfe59cg5cf7g5e4egbeaeg29ac8d00fb1c" version="1">Last Word has already been used this long rest.</content>
        <content contentuid="hd7aaf651g3a0ag505dgbbf6g396a115e4586" version="1">Last Word</content>
        <content contentuid="h8e995049g0155g5826g8334gf5311ed4f3f9" version="1">Unlocks the Last Word grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h58deeaf2g7fd6g5cb9gb53dg96830c2e0103" version="1">Lock-on</content>
        <content contentuid="h44889be1g11d9g55e9ga059g1fc78391eb85" version="1">Add your proficiency bonus to damage against a targeted enemy.</content>
        <content contentuid="h1f5b1232ge771g5078ga86eg3ab18359e742" version="1">Long Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="h3ada472ega21fg5255g8a7bg39be21cc02c2" version="1">Deal additional damage based on the distance to your target.</content>
        <content contentuid="h82b2b368gb4e7g5db6ga986gb2ed358f3cdc" version="1">Stable Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="h814cafeag14ccg5516gb149g4af6f6b3a298" version="1">Advantage on your next firearm attack this turn.</content>
        <content contentuid="hecb315c0gee58g5b97ga583g28d080dc2c93" version="1">Stable Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="hd925b749g0648g5f38g86bcg38cc2eefac9e" version="1">As a class action, sacrifice 20 feet of movement to gain Advantage on your next firearm attack this turn.</content>
        <content contentuid="hfe429d72g1c5eg5e3fg93fdg722ba2e9dc16" version="1">Stable Shot</content>
        <content contentuid="h81f3620dgb400g55c5g95abg94ca3c98544b" version="1">Unlocks the Stable Shot class action.</content>
        <content contentuid="h55c50aabgc3d6g5c1cg9789g505fa5d4bbf5" version="1">Pinpoint Accuracy</content>
        <content contentuid="h5dc3b18bg56ebg56ddga676g90e61bc78228" version="1">Gain +1 to hit at 50 feet or more, and +2 to hit at 70 feet or more.</content>
        <content contentuid="h307f1ad2g9657g57fegae92ge5eb6b98b152" version="1">Headshot</content>
        <content contentuid="ha0adf4aegadfag50f2g9db4g3b88d23072c3" version="1">Spend 5 grit points. Your next firearm attack this turn is an automatic critical hit.</content>
        <content contentuid="h49d8e2cfgc0c1g5807gb097g4a3332ac885a" version="1">Headshot</content>
        <content contentuid="hfdb35b30g6df4g519dgb124g4e729e4bb9d9" version="1">Your next firearm attack this turn is an automatic critical hit.</content>
        <content contentuid="h25257b3fg6eb7g523fgb456g8e75a6174b9d" version="1">Headshot</content>
        <content contentuid="h1967be9ag0e70g5e51gba30g5a46615ed9b1" version="1">Unlocks the Headshot grit ability.</content>
        <content contentuid="h851f176ag3c4bg5951g89d2g98bfe093881d" version="1">Infused Rounds</content>
        <content contentuid="h963f4738g659eg52e2gae59ga62ebf140a5c" version="1">Spend a bonus action to shoot an elementally-infused round, dealing 1d4 Force damage.</content>
        <content contentuid="h8cdc7a84g0159g5e7cgb49eg0f28df2118d3" version="1">Infused Rounds</content>
        <content contentuid="h7aad8a6dgc1b1g5dcegb5f7ga5fd30e32b02" version="1">Unlocks the Infused Rounds attack.</content>
        <content contentuid="h68c4b217gd450g50d5gb72ag15d2da52d800" version="1">Infused Rounds</content>
        <content contentuid="hd2bd8f75g08acg52a9gb35fg33cacf556eff" version="1">Spend a bonus action to shoot an elementally-infused round, dealing 2d4 Force damage.</content>
        <content contentuid="h60eefb8egaf84g5becgb16fgd1ad6dc9eabc" version="1">Improved Infused Rounds</content>
        <content contentuid="he70d6377gfb77g57d0g87c5g5ecba5a282e1" version="1">Infused Rounds damage increases to 2d4.</content>
        <content contentuid="hd199df79g10e6g569aga149g1fbac9463bf1" version="1">Arcane Reload</content>
        <content contentuid="he9ef1003g87b9g5092g9c2dgad911bd9ed4f" version="1">Your weapon magically reloads one bullet per round.</content>
        <content contentuid="h77805d86g5fbbg56a8gb488g0e8f63b171eb" version="1">Arcane Reload</content>
